  "job_B9.5.5_20251003_115024": {
    "chunk_text": ", \u00fee unea\u00f0e hi \u00e6fre mihton manna sweord ondr\u00e6dan, \u00deyses wylla w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fde naht in \u00feysum middanearde, ne he naht secan nolde. Ac ealle \u00fea \u00fee him to comon for \u00f0\u00e6re wisan \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0an lufan, he gewunode, \u00fe\u00e6t he symble hi & gif he hwanne ongeat hwylcra manna gyltas, ne arede he heom n\u00e6fre, \u00fe\u00e6t he heom ne cidde, \u00dea \u00e6t nehstan dydon \u00feysne gewunan gehwylce men, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r landleode w\u00e6ron, \u00fea nearran ge \u00fea \u00dea on sume tid gelamp hit, \u00fe\u00e6t sum mycel aga, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Characterius, se w\u00e6s beswicen \u00dea sona swa \u00fe\u00e6t se drihtnes wer ongeat, he onbead be him \u00feurh swylce \u00e6rendracan, swylce he & he \u00fea mid \u00fey gewitan his agnes manes him ondred & n\u00e6nigra \u00feinga ne dorste gan to \u00f0am He nolde, \u00fe\u00e6t hit gelumpe, \u00fe\u00e6t he him cidde swa hr\u00e6dlice swa he gewuna w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t he Ac he geworhte his lac & asende \u00fea onmang o\u00fera manna lacum & wolde, \u00fe\u00e6t se halga wer huru Ac hit gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle \u00fea lac w\u00e6ron beforan him gebrohte, & he \u00fea se drihtnes wer s\u00e6t lange He geceas & al\u00e6s ealle \u00fea o\u00f0re & on sundron alede, & \u00fea lac, \u00fee he oncneow \u00feurh \u00feone halgan \u00dea for \u00fe\u00e6re wisan w\u00e6s geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t swy\u00f0e mycel ege gefor on \u00fea m\u00e6n, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r",
